abstract: >-
  Companion evaluation dataset for the paper "A Pedagogically
  Oriented Multi-Agent Framework for AI-Assisted Instructional
  Planning with Institutional Memory and Teacher-in-the-Loop
  Learning". Contains evaluation results (objective metrics and
  LLM-as-a-Judge assessments) across 7 academic disciplines, along
  with the complete evaluation pipeline source code including
  statistical tests (paired t-test, Wilcoxon, Cohen's d, ICC,
  Kruskal-Wallis) and position bias diagnostics.
keywords:
  - instructional planning
  - multi-agent systems
  - LLM evaluation
  - educational technology
  - learning activity plans
  - AI-assisted education
